@startuml
title eSIM Profile CFS Order Item Processing

participant "Resource Inventory" as RI #blue
participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue
participant "Resource Catalog\nManagement" as RCM #blue
participant "SM-DP+" as SMDP

== Step 3 (eSIM Profile) ==

ROM -> RCM : 1 **TMF634 Resource Catalog Management**\nGET /resourceSpecification
RCM --> ROM : 2 **TMF634** 200 eSIM Profile Template

ROM -> RI : 3 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nGET /resource (User Equipment)
RI --> ROM : 4 **TMF639** 200 User Equipment (EID , IMEI)

ROM -> RI : 5 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPOST /resource eSIM Profile
RI --> ROM : 6 **TMF639** 204 Resource created eSIM Profile

ROM -> ROM : 7 Update eSIM Profile resource (resourceStatus="Available")
ROM -> ROM : 8 Determine Profile Type for (EID, IMEI)

ROM -> RCM : 9 **(Optional)TMF634 Resource Catalog Management**\nGET /resourceSpecification (SM-DP+ API, Profile Type)
RCM --> ROM : 10 **TMF634** (Optional) 200 SM-DP+ API specification

ROM -> SMDP : 11 **SM-DP+ API call**\nDownloadOrder (Profile Type, EID)
activate SMDP
SMDP -> SMDP : 12 Reserve ICCID
SMDP --> ROM : 13 **SM-DP+ API call** response (ICCID)
deactivate SMDP

ROM -> ROM : 14 Update eSIM Profile resource (resourceStatus="Linked")

ROM -> SMDP : 15 **SM-DP+ API call**\nConfirmOrder (ICCID, EID)
activate SMDP
SMDP -> SMDP : 16 Generate MatchingID
SMDP --> ROM : 17 **SM-DP+ API call** response (MatchingID, SM-DP+ Address)
deactivate SMDP

ROM -> RI : 18 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource eSIM Profile(Matching ID, ICCID, EID, SM-DP+ Address)
RI --> ROM : 19 **TMF639** 204 Resource updated eSIM Profile(Matching ID, ICCID, EID, SM-DP+ Address)

ROM -> ROM : 20 Update eSIM Profile resource (resourceStatus="Released")
ROM -> ROM : 21 update resourceOrderItems (state="completed")

@enduml
